    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49803" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰγδοκόπᾰνον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a pestle</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				11.147
			</span></i> (ap. Valck.<i>Animadv.ad Ammon.</i><i><span class="en">
				p.140
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀγδ-</span> cod.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰγδόλης:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἐπὶ μέρει γεωργῶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγκρος</span></b> , ὁ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκέφαλος</span>,
				Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.204
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἷγμαι</span></b> , <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱγμένος</span></b> , pf. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκνέομαι</span>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰγμαλέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰκμ-</span>, Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.523
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰγμή</span></b> : <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰυγμή</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰυγή</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγνην</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγδην</span>
			.</div>
